OL,3,GNEWSAIrish budget tackles childcare and
OL,4,Aenergy costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Irish government has used its
OL,7,Fbudget to announce measures to help
OL,8,Fwith energy and childcare costs.
OL,10,FTaxes on heating oil and gas will be
OL,11,Fcut and then frozen for the lifetime of
OL,12,Fthe government.
OL,14,FTemporary tax cuts on petrol and
OL,15,Fdiesel, which were introduced earlier
OL,16,Fthis year, will be extended.
OL,18,FChildcare subsidies will be increased
OL,19,Fwhich will be worth up bB,2,220
OL,20,F(#1,882) per child per year.
